crets and nightmarish surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth &amp; Strategy</strong> \u2013 Stay quiet, hide, and use your wits to avoid detection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasure Hunt Mystery</strong> \u2013 Solve puzzles and uncover the truth behind the haunted house.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Horror Atmosphere</strong> \u2013 Spine-chilling sound effects and eerie visuals that keep you on edge.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to survive the <i>House of Terror</i>? Step inside\u2026 if you dare.</p>","developers":["ZERO5GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621260/ee39d5e028783e7f725a7cf25b0c679306889552/header.jpg?t=1767087776","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3621260/857590/c343bea7620fcfa79230107240cc0d14946ff64b/1750454987/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743066640","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3621260/857590/c343bea7620fcfa79230107240cc0d14946ff64b/1750454987/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743066640","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3621260/857590/c343bea7620fcfa79230107240cc0d14946ff64b/1750454987/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1743066640","id":257118434,"name":"RT","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257118434/890c9ab02a65af43ad13270bef7981aea3578276/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743066640"}],"name":"House of Terror","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"",